flowchart TB
  TEST[Testing Interview Topics]
  TEST --> PYRAMID[Testing Pyramid]

  PYRAMID --> UNIT[Unit Tests]
  UNIT --> JUNIT[JUnit 5]
  UNIT --> MOCK[Mockito]
  UNIT --> ASSERT[AssertJ]

  PYRAMID --> INTEG[Integration Tests]
  INTEG --> SLICE[Slice Tests WebMvc DataJpa]
  INTEG --> TC[Testcontainers]
  INTEG --> DB[Database Testing]

  PYRAMID --> E2E[End-to-End Tests]
  E2E --> REST[REST Assured]
  E2E --> SEL[WebDriver]

  TEST --> PERF[Performance Testing]
  PERF --> JMH[JMH Microbenchmarks]
  PERF --> GAT[Gatling Load Tests]

  TEST --> COV[Code Coverage]
  COV --> JACO[JaCoCo]
  COV --> PIT[Pitest Mutation]

  TEST --> CONTRACT[Contract Tests]
  CONTRACT --> CDC[Consumer-Driven]
  CONTRACT --> SPR[Spring Cloud Contract]
